@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Create Purchase Request

DEVELOPER OWNER: Doulat
MODULE: Department / Purchase Requests
TRELLO TASK: Create Purchase Request
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/vCxUl1Bb

PURPOSE:
Form for a department employee to draft and submit a
purchase request with its items and attachments.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Requesting Department

ROUTE: /Department/PurchaseRequests/Create

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- POST Create: save a Draft PurchaseRequest with
  DepartmentId and CreatedByUserId from the signed-in user.
- Add/remove PurchaseRequestItems rows (decimal quantity,
  unit) with server-side validation.
- Submit: Status = Submitted, SubmittedAt (UTC), and a new
  PurchaseRequestReview with the next SubmissionNumber and
  SubmittedSnapshotJson.
- Upload attachments into Documents with PurchaseRequestId.

DEPENDENCIES:
PurchaseRequests, PurchaseRequestItems,
PurchaseRequestReviews, Documents, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
The request goes directly to the Sourcing Officer — there is
no extra department approval stage.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Create Purchase Request";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "New Request";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Describe what your department needs. The request goes directly to the Sourcing Officer.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Request</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-title-1">Title</label><input id="f-title-1" type="text" /></div>
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-justification-2">Justification</label><textarea id="f-justification-2" rows="4"></textarea><small class="pg-hint">Why the department needs this purchase.</small></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-priority-3">Priority</label><select id="f-priority-3"><option>Normal</option><option>Low</option><option>High</option><option>Urgent</option></select></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-needed-by-4">Needed by</label><input id="f-needed-by-4" type="date" /></div>
            </div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-requested-items">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-requested-items">Requested items</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Item / service</th><th scope="col">Specifications</th><th scope="col">Quantity</th><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No items added. A request needs at least one item."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Attachments</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-supporting-documents-5">Supporting documents</label><input id="f-supporting-documents-5" type="file" /><small class="pg-hint">PDF, images or office files. Stored outside wwwroot.</small></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Submit to Sourcing Officer</button><button type="button" class="pg-btn">Save draft</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>
